# Exact bytes everywhere (1.0.1): migrations, fixtures and baselines are pinned by SHA-256, so a checkout must never
# convert line endings (core.autocrlf=true on Windows broke 62 tests in a fresh clone). Only the launchers are converted.
* -text
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.sh text eol=lf
